\end{align}

The general solution is: markdownlint-disable MD037 \begin{align}
c(t) &= \frac{1}{F} \left(\int F r \d{t} + c^* \right) \\
     &= \frac{A}{k} + \frac{B}{k^{2}+(\pi/12)^2}
