&= \lambda^2 + \lambda - 12 \\
&= (\lambda - 3)(\lambda + 4) = 0
\end{align}

So, \lambda_1 = 3 and \lambda_2 = -4. For \lambda_1 = 4,\vv{A}-\lambda_1\vv{I} =
